{'symbol': 'LOW', 'date': '2022-01-27 08:00:00', 'title': "LOWE'S, PETCO TO HARNESS THE POWER OF HOME AND PETS WITH NEW STORE-IN-STORE CONCEPT", 'text': "MOORESVILLE, N.C., JAN. 27, 2022 /PRNEWSWIRE/ --\xa0LOWE'S (NYSE: LOW) AND PETCO HEALTH AND WELLNESS COMPANY, INC. (NASDAQ: WOOF) TODAY ANNOUNCED A PILOT STORE-IN-STORE PROGRAM THAT BRINGS TRUSTED PRODUCTS, SERVICES AND EXPERTISE – FOR BOTH HOME AND PETS – INTO ONE, CONVENIENT STOP AT SELECT LOWE'S LOCATIONS."}